users/k8s-triage-robot","html_url":"https://github.com/k8s-triage-robot","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8s-triage-robot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8s-triage-robot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8s-triage-robot/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8s-triage-robot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8s-triage-robot/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8s-triage-robot/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8s-triage-robot/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8s-triage-robot/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8s-triage-robot/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-05T01:59:51Z","updated_at":"2025-05-05T01:59:51Z","body":"The Kubernetes project has merge-blocking tests that are currently too flaky to consistently pass.\n\nThis bot retests PRs for certain kubernetes repos according to the following rules:\n- The PR does have any `do-not-merge/*` labels\n- The PR does not have the `needs-ok-to-test` label\n- The PR is mergeable (does not have a `needs-rebase` label)\n- The PR is approved (has `cncf-cla: yes`, `lgtm`, `approved` labels)\n- The PR is failing tests required for merge\n\nYou can:\n- Review the [full test history](https://prow.k8s.io/pr-history/?org=kubernetes&repo=kubernetes&pr=131378) for this PR\n- Prevent this bot from retesting with `/lgtm cancel` or `/hold`\n- Help make our tests less flaky by following our [Flaky Tests Guide][1]\n\n/retest\n\n[1]: https://git.k8s.io/community/contributors/devel/sig-testing/flaky-tests.md","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kubernetes/kubernetes/issues/comments/2849735305/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_